__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# The public demo output under artifacts/public-demo/ is committed deliberately: it is
# deterministic (verified byte-identical across repeated runs and across ACE generations), and a
# tagged release must contain the proof its evidence records describe, not only the generator.
# Regenerate with scripts/public_demo.py; the page refuses to render if pinned identities drift.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/public-demo/
artifacts/public-demo/*
!artifacts/public-demo/demo-data.json
!artifacts/public-demo/index.html
!artifacts/public-demo/*.png
